Comment: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Logo
Comment: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Completed Signs
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:41.46,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.38,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:47.45,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.45,0:22:51.09,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:53.94,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:57.51,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.51,0:23:02.57,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:07.01,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:12.22,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:16.03,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.03,0:23:19.87,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:23.75,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.75,0:23:27.54,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:31.37,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.37,0:23:35.21,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.21,0:23:39.08,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:46.78,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.91,0:00:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty easy once you get the hang of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.96,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can lose now.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.54,0:00:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you were after, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.49,0:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.05,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to owe you anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes us even, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:56.87,0:00:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.08,0:01:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:12.83,0:01:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little tired.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself. I've got you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.99,0:01:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:27.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:57.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.68,0:03:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, you shouldn't fight like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.15,0:03:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You say it doesn't hurt, but you're lying.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.51,0:03:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurt just watching you.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.68,0:03:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be hurting yourself just because you can't feel it.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.89,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have won otherwise.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.34,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no talent, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.16,0:03:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you fight like that and win, \Nit's not going to help you out in the end.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And what {\i1}would{\i0} help me?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.06,0:04:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've been turned into this thing, \Nhow can anything help me?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.35,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:06.10,0:04:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a rock that's good for\Nnothing but hunting witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.66,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just pretend to be alive by dragging my own corpse along on strings.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.43,0:04:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What could anyone do to help a rock like me?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.23,0:04:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point even thinking about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.87,0:04:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just want you to be\Nhappy again, Sayaka{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0} fight them, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.84,0:04:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyubey told me. You've got more talent than anyone else, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.69,0:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You could easily beat witches \Nwithout struggling like I do, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.73,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I... That's not...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.23,0:04:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to do something for me, \Nwhy don't you try and do what I've done?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't. Of course not.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.62,0:05:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just give up your humanity out of pity.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not pity. I...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.91,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be all-powerful, but you just\Nsit there and watch me suffer instead.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you know how\N I feel from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.40,0:05:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I say that to her?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.41,0:05:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beyond help now.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.76,0:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Walpurgisnacht should\Nappear within this area.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you basing that on?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Statistics.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Statistics?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.85,0:06:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of the Walpurgis coming to this city before.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.44,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are these\Nstatistics even coming from?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.87,0:06:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of us is exactly\Nthe trustworthy type,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't you think you have to be {\i1}that{\i0} secretive about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.75,0:06:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know as well, Akemi Homura.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face here after what happened?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.46,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. I get the feeling I'm not welcome.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.30,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I came all this way just to give\Nyou some rather important information.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.57,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki Sayaka is depleting herself far faster than I expected.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.71,0:06:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just all the magic she's using;\Nshe's started to carry a curse within herself.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.77,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And whose fault do you think that is?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.98,0:07:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it might become an issue before the Walpurgisnacht arrives.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd best be on your guard.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.30,0:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.67,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.99,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should ask her instead of me.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.29,0:07:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You already know the answer, \Ndon't you, Akemi Homura?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.98,0:07:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be most interested to hear where you obtained that information.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.53,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.22,0:07:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard all I care to hear from you.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.94,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.61,0:07:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to let him go?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.47,0:07:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing that thing won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.63,0:07:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's this issue he\Nmentioned with Miki Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.12,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Soul Gem has become too tainted.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.87,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not purified soon,\Nthe damage will be irreparable.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.68,0:08:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The auxiliary verb "must" means that someone has to do something—
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}an obligation of sorts.\N But "have to" has a different—
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.41,0:08:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've gone after her back then.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.81,0:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you live in this direction?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.87,0:08:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen you go home this way.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.89,0:08:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. To be honest, \NI live in exactly the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did you walk this way today?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamijou{*}-kun{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.72,0:08:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.72,0:08:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't come home?\NNot since last night?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay... Um... I understand.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.92,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to find Sayaka{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get it?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.25,0:10:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't afford to\Nwaste any more magic.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:17.71,0:10:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on witches, not familiars.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.52,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.54,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.41,0:10:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Soul Gem is already at its limit.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to purify it right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.33,0:10:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning this time?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.58,0:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.08,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to be\Nquestioning others right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.12,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does being helped by someone else bother you that much?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be like the rest of you magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.87,0:10:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I've decided.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.90,0:10:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't associate with people who use or abandon others.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any reward for my work.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.93,0:11:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never use magic for my own benefit.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.07,0:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.86,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when I can no longer\Nkill any more witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I wouldn't be\Nany use anyway, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.29,0:11:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.25,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like me has no\Nother place in this world.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to save you.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.73,0:11:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you believe me?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.35,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just get this feeling...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.31,0:11:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're a liar.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.52,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the eyes of someone who's given up on everything.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.52,0:11:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always saying empty words.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no different.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.39,0:11:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you want to help me,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.13,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know that's not\Nwhat you're really thinking.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.29,0:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.06,0:12:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how you keep\Nmaking Madoka suffer.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.25,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with her.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.00,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Everything I do is for her.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty sharp.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.01,0:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to save you.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.26,0:12:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't want Madoka to\Nsee you destroy yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.31,0:12:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse me here,\Nyou'll die either way.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.57,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you keep making Madoka suffer...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.86,0:12:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,then I might as well...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.86,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,kill you myself, here and now...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.53,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hurry up and get out of here!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you trying to save her?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.00,0:13:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You can't use that weird technique of yours when I'm holding onto you like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.94,0:13:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, man. You can't let that dumb slut make any excuses.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.47,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get hold of\Nall the money she makes.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.80,0:13:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are idiots, y'know?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.65,0:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment they get some money they'll blow it all on stupid shit.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.87,0:13:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, seriously, man. You can't treat those bitches like real people.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.96,0:13:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta train them like the dogs they are.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.59,0:13:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My bitch gets off on that, you know.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.87,0:13:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta threaten to smack 'em one and they'll shut right up.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.34,0:14:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But give 'em an inch and they'll be all over you, \Nwhining about getting married and shit.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't let up on 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.22,0:14:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a cabaret girl like her's gonna make the same kinda money in ten years.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.07,0:14:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch needs to learn her place, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And man, don't get me started on what a pain it is to dump 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn good at that,\N Shou{*}-san{*}. I'm really jealous.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.99,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I gotta learn from—
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me more about her.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.43,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman you were just talking about. Tell me more about her.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You in middle school, kid?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.96,0:14:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be out so late at night.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.27,0:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman probably loves you and tries her hardest to make you happy.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.97,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you're comparing her to a dog?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.93,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not even going to thank her?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to get rid of her when she's no longer useful?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her problem? You know this kid?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.42,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.70,0:14:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this world is even worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.24,0:14:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I been fighting for? Tell me.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.71,0:14:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me right this second.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:58.09,0:14:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'll...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, where are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.65,0:15:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me too?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.03,0:15:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did, would you turn Sayaka{*}-chan{*} back?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't. That's beyond my power.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.11,0:15:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You once said I could become a incredibly strong magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.41,0:15:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that true?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.60,0:15:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible doesn't begin to describe it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.49,0:15:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd become a magical girl\N of unimaginable power.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.21,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably the strongest in the world.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.09,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd accepted your offer, would Sayaka{*}-chan{*} still have become a magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.81,0:15:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka made her own wish come true.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.67,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you had nothing\N to do with her decision.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.22,0:16:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it bluntly, your latent power is on a level beyond what should be theoretically possible.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.38,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know just as much as you do.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.54,0:16:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.59,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to release your power,\Nyou wouldn't just unleash a miracle—
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.57,0:16:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you might be able to bend the very laws of the universe itself.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.47,0:16:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine why you alone have so much potential resting within you.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.23,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought there was\Nnothing special about me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.73,0:16:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That I'd just kind of stumble through life,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.93,0:16:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,never being of any use or help to anyone.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.87,0:16:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was frustrating, and it\Nmade me feel really lonely.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.88,0:16:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought I couldn't\N do anything about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.50,0:17:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like reality turned\Nout to be quite different.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.64,0:17:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, if you wish for it, you might even become an all-powerful god.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.20,0:17:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I be able to do what you couldn't?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.78,0:17:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.78,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I made a contract with you, \Ncould I return Sayaka{*}-chan{*} to normal?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be child's play for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.22,0:17:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that wish worth trading away your very soul?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means I can help Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.97,0:17:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become a—
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.97,0:17:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How could you?! \NYou didn't have to kill him!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.21,0:17:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why... Why are you always sacrificing yourself?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.52,0:18:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't demean yourself by saying that you \Ncan't help anyone or that you're useless.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.23,0:18:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about all the people\N who care about you!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.99,0:18:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just cut it out!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.62,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you understand that there are people who would grieve if you died?!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.86,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you consider the people who try so hard to protect you?!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.92,0:18:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.97,0:18:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.97,0:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.22,0:18:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.65,0:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.83,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to look for Sayaka{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.78,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.81,0:18:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.70,0:18:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.58,0:18:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that was pointless,\Nbut you did it anyway.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.42,0:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't learn, do you?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.55,0:19:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have plenty of spares, but you can't just go around destroying them for no reason.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a waste.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.50,0:19:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the second time you've killed me.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.32,0:19:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm starting to understand how you fight.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:36.58,0:19:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was time-manipulation magic, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.83,0:19:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that was the case.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.79,0:19:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not from this timeline, are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.74,0:19:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all about who you are\Nand what you're planning.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're trying\Nso hard to stop me.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.65,0:20:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that determined to change Kaname Madoka's fate?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.73,0:20:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.51,0:20:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, you will\Nnot have your way.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.88,0:20:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.11,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say... Incubator?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.04,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how long are you gonna keep this up?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.74,0:20:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for wasting your time.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.55,0:20:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That doesn't sound like you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.60,0:20:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.13,0:20:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I don't really care anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.88,0:20:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember what I thought was so important, so worth protecting...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.72,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,None of it makes any sense anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.07,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The balance of hope and despair\Nin the world cancels out to zero.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me that once, didn't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.60,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I finally understand what you meant.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.08,0:21:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I managed to save a few people,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.15,0:21:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but in exchange, hatred and\N jealousy filled my heart.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I even hurt my best friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.97,0:21:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka, please tell me you're not...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:22.25,0:21:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever we pray for someone's happiness, \Nsomeone else must be cursed in exchange.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.00,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's how we magical girls work.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.96,0:21:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I really was an idiot.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.11,0:22:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world, women who have yet to fully grow are called "girls," right?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.69,0:22:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, it only makes sense that you, \Nwho will one day grow into witches,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.41,0:22:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,should be called "magical girls."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:26.16,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:56.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.72,0:24:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}This may sound foolish,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.23,0:24:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}but I don't want to give up until we \Nknow for sure that she can't be saved.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.78,0:24:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}There's no way I'd allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:05.74,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:07.81,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:11.42,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:32.87,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:48.53,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:30.70,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:33.19,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:34.81,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:38.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
